(Apex Institute of Technology & Science - University Prospectus 2026) '
() '
(1. Merit-Based Scholarships:) '
(- Students with JEE Main percentile above 95 receive a 50% tuition fee waiver for all four years.) '
(- State Board Toppers \(Top 10 rank holders\) receive a 100% full tuition scholarship including hostel accommodation.) '
(- Need-Based Financial Aid: Families with annual income below INR 3 Lakhs can apply for the Vidya Samman Grant covering up to 75% of academic expenses.) '
() '
(2. Admission Counseling & Documents Required:) '
(- Class 10th and 12th original mark sheets.) '
(- Transfer Certificate \(TC\) and Migration Certificate.) '
(- Valid Government ID Proof \(Aadhaar Card / Passport\).) '
(- Category / Caste certificate if applying under reserved quotas.) '
ET
endstream
