(Campus Life, Hostel Code of Conduct & Facilities) '
() '
(1. Hostel Timings & Curfew Policy:) '
(- All student hostels \(Aryabhata Boys Hostel and Gargi Girls Hostel\) have an evening in-time curfew of 9:30 PM on weekdays.) '
(- On Saturdays and Sundays, curfew is extended up to 10:30 PM with prior warden permission.) '
(- Night-out passes require an online request submitted via the Student ERP at least 24 hours in advance, verified by parent SMS OTP.) '
() '
(2. Library & Central Computing Facilities:) '
(- Central Library is open 24x7 during end-semester examination periods and from 8:00 AM to 11:00 PM on regular days.) '
(- High-speed 1 Gbps Wi-Fi is available across all academic blocks, hostels, and cafeteria zones.) '
() '
(3. Anti-Ragging Policy:) '
(- Zero-tolerance policy against any form of ragging or harassment. Helpline: 1800-180-5522.) '
ET
endstream
