(Academic Regulations & Evaluation Scheme) '
() '
(1. Attendance Requirement:) '
(- Minimum mandatory attendance is 75% per subject to appear in End-Semester Examinations.) '
(- Medical condonation of up to 10% is permitted upon submission of government hospital certificates within 7 days of absence.) '
() '
(2. Grading System & SGPA/CGPA Calculation:) '
(- Grade A+: 90 to 100 marks \(Grade Point 10\)) '
(- Grade A: 80 to 89 marks \(Grade Point 9\)) '
(- Grade B+: 70 to 79 marks \(Grade Point 8\)) '
(- Grade B: 60 to 69 marks \(Grade Point 7\)) '
(- Passing minimum is 40 marks in each subject \(Grade C\).) '
() '
(3. Placement Eligibility Criteria:) '
(- Minimum CGPA of 6.5 with no active backlogs is mandatory to participate in campus placement drives starting from Semester 7.) '
ET
